<noinclude>
{{Documentation|doc=
{{Protection}}
This {{ll|PZwiki:Mboxes|mbox}} is used to indicate that a page is updated to a specific version of the game.

== Usage ==
=== Parameters ===
; <code>1</code> {{sup|required}}
: Game version the page was updated in, default to <code>Unknown version</code>.

; <code>hidecat</code>
: If set to <code>true</code>, will not add the page to any version category.

; <code>2</code>
: Set to an <code>oldid</code> to create a permanent link to a specific revision. Used to link to a revision for an old version of the game.
: To get an oldid:
:# In the right sidebar (3 dots on citizen) select "Permanent link" to get the current revision. Or, go to the page history {{Key|Alt|Shift|h}}, then select the desired revision.
: Then, in the URL, there will be <code>oldid=12345</code>, the <code>oldid</code> is the string of numbers after the <code>{{=}}</code>.

== Example ==
* {{tll|Page version|{{Current version|unstable}}}} - Updated to latest unstable build
{{Page version|{{Current version|unstable}}|hidecat=true|id=unstable}}

* {{tll|Page version|{{Current version|unstable}}|2{{=}}3}} - Updated to latest unstable build and an oldid provided
{{Page version|{{Current version|unstable}}|2=3|hidecat=true|id=unstable_oldid}}

* {{tll|Page version|42.0.2}} - Updated to an outdated unstable build
{{Page version|42.0.2|hidecat=true|id=outdated_unstable}}

* {{tll|Page version|42.0.2|2{{=}}3}} - Updated to an outdated unstable build and an oldid provided
{{Page version|42.0.2|2=3|hidecat=true|id=outdated_unstable_oldid}}

* {{tll|Page version|41.78.16}} - Updated to the latest stable build
{{Page version|{{Current version|stable}}|hidecat=true|id=stable}}

* {{tll|Page version|41.65}} - Outdated
{{Page version|41.65|hidecat=true|outdated}}

{{Translation guide|<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">{{#switch: {{{1|}}}
| stable_title = This page has been revised for the current ''stable'' version ({{{2}}}).
| stable_content = Help by adding any missing content.
| stable_note = Parts of this page may have been [[PZwiki:Project Build 42 Update#Automations|automatically]] updated to the latest build ({{ll|Build {{Current version|unstable}}|{{Current version|unstable}}}}).
| unstable_latest_title = This page has been updated to the current ''unstable'' beta version ({{{2}}}).
| unstable_latest_content = There may be additional features that are not in the stable version ({{ll|Build {{Current version|stable}}|{{Current version|stable}}}}).
| unstable_latest_note = Help by adding any missing content.
| unstable_outdated_title = This page has been updated to an ''unstable'' beta version ({{{2}}}).
| unstable_outdated_content = There may be additional features that are not in the stable version ({{ll|Build {{Current version|stable}}|{{Current version|stable}}}}).
| unstable_outdated_note = Help get this page updated to the current unstable version ({{ll|Build {{Current version|unstable}}|{{Current version|unstable}}}}).
| outdated_title = This page was last updated for an ''older'' version ({{{2}}}).
| outdated_content = The current stable version is {{ll|Build {{Current version|stable}}|{{Current version|stable}}}}, so information on this page may be inaccurate.
| outdated_note = Help get this page updated by adding any missing content.
| #default = {{Error|translation}}
}}
</syntaxhighlight>}}

